===Etymology===
From the {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|snókr||a snake}} or {{m|non|snákr||''only in poetry''; a snake}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*snakô}}; cognates include the Danish {{m|da|snog||a snake}}, Swedish {{m|sv|snok}}, English {{m|en|snake}}.

